From dc285cc3fe0d7b3c91eb46ce218fddfe580eaf17 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jan Dominiak <janx.dominiak@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Apr 2020 07:57:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] PONRTSYS-6060: Add missing LAN Ethernet PM counters to
 ethtool

Mib_counters implementation extended to support new counters:
* RxOverflowError
* RxGoodPausePkts
* TxPauseCount
* TxExcessCollCount
* TxLateCollCount
* TxSingleCollCount
* TxMultCollCount
